    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n29819" root="عق" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عِقَّانٌ</span></b>  <i>Shoots that come forth from the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُصُول</span>
[meaning <i>trunks,</i> or <i>stems,</i>] of palm-trees and of
grape-vines; (S, O, K;) <i>and which, if not cut
off, cause the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصول</span> <i>to become vitiated,</i> or <i>unsound.</i>
(S, O.) [See also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صُنْبُورٌ</span>: and see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَوَاقٌّ</span>, below.]

